body.value:
{
  "sections": {
    "pa-hero": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<style>
.pa-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#140d08;color:#f6ead2;border-radius:0}
.pa-hero__img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:70% 50%}
.pa-hero__shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,9,5,.92) 0%,rgba(15,9,5,.75) 40%,rgba(15,9,5,.05) 75%)}
.pa-hero__in{position:relative;max-width:var(--page-width,120rem);margin:0 auto;padding:5.6rem 1.6rem 4.8rem;min-height:34rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.pa-hero__kicker{font-size:1.2rem;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d8b46a;margin:0 0 1rem}
.pa-hero h1{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(3rem,4.6vw,5.2rem);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 1.2rem;max-width:56rem}
.pa-hero__desc{max-width:46rem;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.55;color:#eadcc0;margin:0}
.pa-hero__desc p{margin:0}
.pa-hero__count{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.4rem;font-size:1.3rem;color:#d8b46a}
.pa-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 2rem;margin-top:1.8rem;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:1.3rem;color:#f6ead2}
.pa-trust li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}
.pa-trust li:before{content:"";width:.8rem;height:.8rem;border-radius:50%;background:#d8b46a;flex:none}
.pa-chips{max-width:var(--page-width,120rem);margin:0 auto;padding:1.6rem 1.6rem .4rem;display:flex;gap:.8rem;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}
.pa-chips::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.pa-chip{flex:none;padding:.9rem 1.8rem;border:1px solid #c9a24f;border-radius:99px;font-size:1.4rem;text-decoration:none;color:#3a2a12;background:#fff;white-space:nowrap}
.pa-chip.is-on{background:#1a120b;color:#f3d999;border-color:#1a120b}
@media (max-width:749px){
 .pa-hero__img{position:relative;height:20rem;object-position:78% 50%}
 .pa-hero__shade{display:none}
 .pa-hero__in{padding:2rem 1.6rem 2.4rem;min-height:0}
 .pa-hero__desc{font-size:1.4rem}
 .pa-trust{font-size:1.25rem;gap:.6rem 1.4rem}
}
</style>
{%- assign pa_tags = current_tags | join: ',' -%}
<div class="pa-hero">
  {%- if collection.image -%}
    {{ collection.image | image_url: width: 2000 | image_tag: class: 'pa-hero__img', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', widths: '750,1100,1500,2000', sizes: '100vw', alt: collection.image.alt | default: collection.title }}
    <div class="pa-hero__shade"></div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="pa-hero__in">
    <p class="pa-hero__kicker">Lattafa · Armaf · Afnan</p>
    <h1>{{ collection.title }}</h1>
    <div class="pa-hero__desc">{{ collection.description }}</div>
    <span class="pa-hero__count">{{ collection.all_products_count }} productos</span>
    <ul class="pa-trust">
      <li>Perfumes originales</li>
      <li>Paga al recibir</li>
      <li>Despacho gratis a todo Chile</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<nav class="pa-chips" aria-label="Categorías de perfumes árabes">
  <a class="pa-chip{% if current_tags == blank %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ collection.url }}">Todos</a>
{%- if collection.all_tags contains 'kit' -%}
  <a class="pa-chip{% if pa_tags contains 'kit' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ collection.url }}/kit">Kits y packs</a>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- if collection.all_tags contains 'unitario' -%}
  <a class="pa-chip{% if pa_tags contains 'unitario' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ collection.url }}/unitario">Unitarios</a>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- if collection.all_tags contains 'mujer' -%}
  <a class="pa-chip{% if pa_tags contains 'mujer' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ collection.url }}/mujer">Mujer</a>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- if collection.all_tags contains 'hombre' -%}
  <a class="pa-chip{% if pa_tags contains 'hombre' %} is-on{% endif %}" href="{{ collection.url }}/hombre">Hombre</a>
  {%- endif -%}
</nav>
",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "main-collection-product-grid": {
      "type": "main-collection-product-grid",
      "settings": {
        "products_per_page": 24,
        "columns_desktop": 4,
        "image_ratio": "square",
        "show_secondary_image": true,
        "show_vendor": false,
        "show_rating": false,
        "enable_quick_add": true,
        "enable_filtering": true,
        "filter_type": "horizontal",
        "enable_sorting": true,
        "columns_mobile": "2",
        "padding_top": 12,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "pa-seo": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<style>
.pa-seo{max-width:86rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.6rem;color:rgba(var(--color-foreground),.8);font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.65}
.pa-seo h2{font-size:2rem;margin:0 0 1rem}
.pa-seo h3{font-size:1.6rem;margin:1.8rem 0 .6rem}
.pa-seo p{margin:0 0 1rem}
</style>
<div class="pa-seo">
  <h2>Perfumes árabes originales en Chile</h2>
  <p>Los perfumes árabes son conocidos por sus notas intensas de ámbar, vainilla, oud y especias, y por su buena duración en la piel. En esta colección encuentras fragancias de casas árabes como Lattafa, Armaf y Afnan, en presentación individual o en kits para ahorrar.</p>
  <h3>¿Kit o unitario?</h3>
  <p>Si ya sabes cuál te gusta, elige el perfume unitario. Si quieres variar según la ocasión o regalar, los kits reúnen varios perfumes en un solo pedido.</p>
  <h3>¿Cómo pago?</h3>
  <p>Pagas al recibir tu pedido en casa, con despacho a todo Chile.</p>
</div>
",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 48
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "pa-hero",
    "main-collection-product-grid",
    "pa-seo"
  ]
}
